/*
Must create a project template that has:

- 3D character controller with entity called Player
- Basic Scene manager flow implemented with Main scene and level scene
- Basic UI menu and options panel imported
- Instancer script running
- Poki SDK imported

- Basic Gameplay.js script, with working networked player movement

When making a new project, should change:
- Colyseus URL (or keep localhost)
- Game Analytics SDK
*/

